{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anxiety Bot in Space! is a reimagining of an old school arcade game. The premise is simple, You must help Anxiety Bot survive as long as possible. As time progresses and your score increases, so will the meteor field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Powerups to prolong your run as long as possible! But Beware! There are debuffs that could cause you some problems along the way! There are currently two power ups and one debuff. Triple shot for when you feel overwhelmed. Ghost mode for when you need a quick escape. Engine Failure debuff to leave you stranded for a short time while Anxiety Bot fixes your engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will Anxiety Bot survive with you at the helm?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3110580?t=1754497882","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3110580?t=1754497882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110580/02e27e928c02fb250681210749b5dedeb05fd298/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754497882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110580/02e27e928c02fb250681210749b5dedeb05fd298/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754497882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains violence blood depictions"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anxiety Bot in Space! is a reimagining of an old school arcade game. The premise is simple, You must help Anxiety Bot survive as long as possible. As time progresses and your score increases, so will the meteor field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Powerups to prolong your run as long as possible! But Beware! There are debuffs that could cause you some problems along